      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The components of a holistic pain assessment process in advanced cancer are presented. Central to the assessment and management process is recognition of different types of cancer pain, which have their own individual management emphasis. An overview of nociceptive cancer pain management is presented outlining current drugs available and the 'analgesic ladder' approach."},
